\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. What shall  I render to my God
\par For all His mercy's store?
\par I'll take the gifts He hath bestowed,
\par And humbly ask for more.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The sacred cup of saving grace
\par I will with thanks receive,
\par And all His promises embrace,
\par And to His glory live.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. My vows I will to His great name
\par Before His people pay,
\par And all I have, and all I am,
\par Upon His altar lay.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Thy lawful servant, Lord, I owe
\par To Thee whate'er is mine,
\par Born in Thy family below,
\par And by redemption Thine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Thy  hands created me, Thy hands
\par From sin have set me free,
\par The mercy that hath loosed my bands
\par Hath bound me fast to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. The God of all-redeeming grace
\par My God I will proclaim,
\par Offer the sacrifice of praise,
\par And call upon His name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. Praise Him, ye saints, the God of love,
\par Who hath my sins forgiven,
\par Till, gathered to the church above,
\par We sing the songs of heaven.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

